e state cardiac muscle cells develop from cardiac myoblast, which in turn develop from muscle stem cell.\")\n\n  Line 22673: AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GO_REF:0000034\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0007010 \"Skeletogenic cell that has the potential to transform into an osteoblast, and develops from neural crest or mesodermal cells.\")\n\n  Line 22851: SubClassOf(obo:CL_0008006 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002203 obo:CL_0008003))\n\n  Line 22925: EquivalentClasses(obo:CL_0008017 ObjectIntersectionOf(obo:CL_0000056 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:BFO_0000050 obo:UBERON_0001134) ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002203 obo:CL_0008002)))\n\n  Line 22931: EquivalentClasses(obo:CL_0008018 ObjectIntersectionOf(obo:CL_0000056 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002203 obo:CL_0008003)))\n\n  Line 22947: SubClassOf(obo:CL_0008020 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002203 obo:CL_0008017))\n\n  Line 24624: EquivalentClasses(obo:CL_0010021 ObjectIntersectionOf(obo:CL_0000056 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002203 obo:CL_0000746)))\n\n  Line 24893: AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"BTO:0002900\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:30719026\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:32733468\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0011031 \"A dendritic cell that develops from a monocyte.\")\n\n  Line 25812: SubClassOf(obo:CL_1000274 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002203 obo:CL_0000351))\n\n  Line 30763: AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:12637172\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_4023069 \"A GABAergic interneuron that develops from the medial ganglionic eminence and has migrated to the cerebral cortex.\")\n\n  Line 30772: AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:20130169\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_4023070 \"OBSOLETE. A GABAergic cortical interneuron that develops from the caudal ganglionic eminence and has migrated to the cerebral cortex.\")\n\n  Line 32944: SubClassOf(obo:CL_4033065 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002203 obo:CL_0000980))\n\n  Line 32948: Annota